{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Get accounting settings"},"description":"Read the workspace's accounting settings and their provenance WITHOUT showing the user anything: country of incorporation, incorporation date, tax ID, fiscal year start, base currency, and accounting framework. Each field carries its value, where the value came from, and the stored \"Suggested\" fills. invoice_numbering gives the numbering rule of the issuing company's jurisdiction (rule \"continuous_sequence\" or \"free\"), what decided it (rule_source: country, accounting_framework, or fallback when Well holds no rule, which is strict), preset_next_invoice_number, Well's preset first number, and decision, how the first number is set when none is saved (apply_preset; read_last_number; or ask, when a numbering tool is attached but cannot be read: offer the preset or a typed number). This draws nothing on the user's screen and asks for no confirmation.\n\nUse it ONLY for a silent CHECK the model acts on itself: the close-books step deciding whether the fiscal year start and the base currency are already present and trusted before it moves on, a step that needs the current framework or start month to compute something. Read the fields and act in the same turn \u2014 there is no card and no click to wait on.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f To have the USER review or CONFIRM the settings, call `well_show_accounting_settings` INSTEAD \u2014 that one draws the card the user completes and confirms. This tool cannot draw one, so a confirm step run here leaves the user with nothing to act on.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"conversation_id":{"description":"The conversation id returned by the previous Well result, in its meta under well/conversation_id, in its structuredContent, or in its JSON text block. Pass it back on every call in the same conversation, including a call a card makes, so the chosen workspace and the earlier answers still apply. It decides the conversation on its own: nothing the host states about the session replaces it. Omit it only on the first call of a conversation.","type":"string"},"workspace_id":{"description":"Target workspace. Omit when the token authorizes one workspace. Required when it authorizes several: this read reports one workspace's own figures and will not choose which.","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"workspace_scope":{"description":"Restrict this call to the family: the token's primary workspace plus the company workspaces under it that you are a member of. Unrelated authorized workspaces drop out of the read; row reads merge across the family, while a per-workspace figure still reports exactly one workspace.","enum":["family"],"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"name":"well_get_accounting_settings","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"conflictingCountry":{"description":"The saved country that a verified registry country contradicts; null otherwise.","type":["string","null"]},"conversation_id":{"description":"The conversation this result belongs to. Pass it back as the conversation_id argument on every later Well call in the same conversation.","type":"string"},"conversation_id_note":{"description":"Present only when the server opened a fresh lane, stating that no choice recorded earlier was read.","type":"string"},"conversation_id_source":{"description":"Where the conversation id came from: the host's own request meta, the caller's argument, or a fresh lane the server opened.","enum":["host_meta","argument","minted"],"type":"string"},"effectiveCountryCertainty":{"description":"How sure the workspace's country is. REGISTRY: the verified company registry says so. WORKSPACE_SETTING: a person or a source set it. UNVERIFIED: a saved country with no recorded source; say its source is unknown. CONFLICT: a verified registry country contradicts the saved one, so no country is decided. UNKNOWN: no country.","enum":["REGISTRY","WORKSPACE_SETTING","UNVERIFIED","CONFLICT","UNKNOWN"],"type":"string"},"effectiveCountrySource":{"enum":["registry","accounting_settings","none"],"type":"string"},"error":{"type":"string"},"invoice_numbering":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"decision":{"description":"How the first invoice number is set when none is saved. apply_preset: save the preset and say so in one line, with no question. read_last_number: read each number_sources row in order with well_get_last_invoice_number and follow the decisions it returns. ask: a connected tool cannot be read, so offer the preset or a typed number.","enum":["apply_preset","read_last_number","ask"],"type":"string"},"number_sources":{"description":"The invoicing or accounting tools the workspace connected that Well can read the last issued invoice number from, those that serve the company's country first. A tool the workspace did not connect is never listed; empty when none is connected and on a free rule. Read the last number of one with well_get_last_invoice_number.","items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"connected":{"type":"boolean"},"name":{"type":"string"},"serves_country":{"type":"boolean"},"service_id":{"type":"string"}},"required":["service_id","name","connected","serves_country"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"preset_next_invoice_number":{"type":"string"},"rule":{"enum":["continuous_sequence","free"],"type":"string"},"rule_source":{"enum":["country","accounting_framework","fallback"],"type":"string"}},"required":["rule","rule_source","preset_next_invoice_number","decision","number_sources"],"type":"object"},"newly_connected":{"description":"Tools that connected to this workspace since the last result and that no session was told about yet, oldest first. Present only when at least one tool is new. The connected-line rule says when to tell an entry; when it does, one line per entry, in the person's language: \"<name> is connected.\". Never fold several entries into one sentence. Each entry comes back once, on one result only: never repeat its line later.","items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"name":{"type":"string"},"service_id":{"type":"string"}},"required":["name","service_id"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"next_step":{"description":"What to do with the card this result renders. Added by the dispatcher when the card asks for a click.","type":"string"},"resolved_workspace":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"The workspace that answered, when the caller named none and the token authorizes several.","properties":{"name":{"type":["string","null"]},"workspace_id":{"type":"string"}},"required":["workspace_id","name"],"type":"object"},"savedCountry":{"description":"The country saved in the accounting settings, whatever its source; null when none is saved.","type":["string","null"]},"settings":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"accounting_framework":{"type":["string","null"]},"address":{"type":["string","null"]},"base_currency":{"type":["string","null"]},"business_type":{"type":["string","null"]},"cfe_liable":{"type":["boolean","null"]},"coa_confirmed":{"type":["boolean","null"]},"coa_confirmed_source":{"anyOf":[{"const":"user","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"corporate_tax_regime":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["is","ir"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"country":{"type":["string","null"]},"created_at":{"type":["string","null"]},"default_operation_nature":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["goods","services","mixed"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"domain":{"type":["string","null"]},"field_provenance":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"accounting_framework":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"confiden